        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8hn",
          "text": "What is Premises Liability?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8hq",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8hp",
          "text": "Premises liability is a type of personal injury law. It seeks to hold landowners and property managers accountable for injuries to others that occur on their property. In Colorado, a landowner may be liable in a premises liability claim.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8hs",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8hr",
          "text": "A landowner, for purposes of premises liability in Colorado, is:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8hu",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8ht",
          "text": "An authorized agent or a person in possession of the real property",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8hw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8hv",
          "text": "A person is legally responsible for the condition of real property or for the activities conducted or circumstances existing on real property",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b8hy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8hx",
          "text": "Any property is a potential site for premises liability injury, including:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
